#. reimuReview.reimu.2
#: src/js/festival-model.js:252
msgctxt "text:reimuReview.reimu.2"
msgid ""
"The warning vanishes before the danmaku; by the stop signal, spectators can "
"only see what already happened."
msgstr "予兆が弾幕より先に消える。停止時に見えるのは既に起きたことだけ。"

#. reimuReview.reimu.3.0
#: src/js/festival-model.js:253
msgctxt "text:reimuReview.reimu.3.0"
msgid "Extend the cue to at least 1.2 seconds or lower low-altitude density."
msgstr "予兆を1.2秒以上にするか低空密度を下げる。"

#. reimuReview.reimu.2
#: src/js/festival-model.js:260
msgctxt "text:reimuReview.reimu.2.2"
msgid "Declared attendance exceeds the narrowest of route, stage, or food court."
msgstr "申告人数が経路・舞台・食堂の最狭部を超える。"

#. reimuReview.reimu.3.0
#: src/js/festival-model.js:261
msgctxt "text:reimuReview.reimu.3.0.2"
msgid "Cap concurrent attendance at {value0}."
msgstr "同時収容は{value0}を上限。"

#. reimuReview.reimu.2
#: src/js/festival-model.js:268
msgctxt "text:reimuReview.reimu.2.3"
msgid "The stopping rule is not yet one sentence the field can follow."
msgstr "停止規則が現場で実行できる一文になっていない。"

#. reimuReview.reimu.3.0
#: src/js/festival-model.js:269
msgctxt "text:reimuReview.reimu.3.0.3"
msgid "Name the signal, first actor, and first exit to open."
msgstr "合図・最初の担当・最初に開く退路を記す。"

#. reimuReview.reimu.2
#: src/js/festival-model.js:272
msgctxt "text:reimuReview.reimu.2.4"
msgid "Cue, stop, and physical exit fit on one notice."
msgstr "予兆・停止・物理退路を一枚の掲示で説明できる。"

#. nitoriReview.nitori.2
#: src/js/festival-model.js:280
msgctxt "text:nitoriReview.nitori.2"
msgid ""
"Main and backup combined are insufficient; another layer of kappa tape does "
"not create capacity."
msgstr "主系統と予備を足しても不足。河童テープを重ねても容量は増えない。"

#. nitoriReview.nitori.3.0
#: src/js/festival-model.js:281
msgctxt "text:nitoriReview.nitori.3.0"
msgid "Lower density, attendance, or evening load."
msgstr "密度・来場者・夜公演負荷を下げる。"

#. nitoriReview.nitori.2
#: src/js/festival-model.js:288
msgctxt "text:nitoriReview.nitori.2.2"
msgid ""
"Output margin is large, but prototype reactors lack a public load test; "
"capacity is not reliability."
msgstr "出力余裕は大きいが、試作炉は公開負荷試験未完。容量を信頼性と同一視しない。"

#. nitoriReview.nitori.3.0
#: src/js/festival-model.js:289
msgctxt "text:nitoriReview.nitori.3.0.2"
msgid "Retain per-reactor isolation and lighting backup of a different type."
msgstr "炉ごとの切離し権と異型照明予備を確保。"

#. nitoriReview.nitori.2
#: src/js/festival-model.js:296
msgctxt "text:nitoriReview.nitori.2.3"
msgid ""
"The system can run, but backup or power credit becomes an ownership question "
"after opening."
msgstr "運転可能だが、予備電源や給電署名が開祭後に主催権問題となる。"

#. nitoriReview.nitori.3.0
#: src/js/festival-model.js:297
msgctxt "text:nitoriReview.nitori.3.0.3"
msgid "Jointly record every switchover, not only the festival-day peak."
msgstr "全切替を共同記録し、祭日最高出力だけを残さない。"

#. nitoriReview.nitori.2
#: src/js/festival-model.js:300
msgctxt "text:nitoriReview.nitori.2.4"
msgid "Main grid, backup, recovery tools, and duty names share one diagram."
msgstr "主系統・予備・回収工具・当番が同じ図にある。"

#. eirinReview.eirin.2
#: src/js/festival-model.js:308
msgctxt "text:eirinReview.eirin.2"
msgid ""
"Expected presentations exceed medical capacity, or maximum density lacks "
"sufficient cueing."
msgstr "予測受診が救護容量を超えるか、最高密度に十分な予兆がない。"

#. eirinReview.eirin.3.0
#: src/js/festival-model.js:309
msgctxt "text:eirinReview.eirin.3.0"
msgid "Add dual stations, reduce density, or cap concurrent entry."
msgstr "二站化・密度低下・同時入場制限を行う。"

#. eirinReview.eirin.2
#: src/js/festival-model.js:316
msgctxt "text:eirinReview.eirin.2.2"
msgid ""
"A large near-full-moon event with one station makes bamboo transfers and "
"wavelength reactions share one queue."
msgstr "満月近くの大型行事で一站のみ。竹林搬送と波長反応が同じ列を使う。"

#. eirinReview.eirin.3.0
#: src/js/festival-model.js:317
msgctxt "text:eirinReview.eirin.3.0.2"
msgid "Add gate screening; Reisen must not double as traffic guide."
msgstr "門前一次判定を追加し、鈴仙は交通誘導を兼任しない。"

#. eirinReview.eirin.2
#: src/js/festival-model.js:320
msgctxt "text:eirinReview.eirin.2.3"
msgid "Medical capacity, lunar load, and nearest stopping staff are counted together."
msgstr "救護容量・月相負荷・最寄り停止担当を同時に計上。"

#. ayaReview.aya.2
#: src/js/festival-model.js:328
msgctxt "text:ayaReview.aya.2"
msgid ""
"Aya has already typeset “Grand Opening.” She agrees to reserve correction "
"space, not to leave the front page empty."
msgstr "文は「盛大開幕」を組版済み。訂正版の場所は残すが、一面を空ける同意はない。"

#. ayaReview.aya.3.0
#: src/js/festival-model.js:329
msgctxt "text:ayaReview.aya.3.0"
msgid "Every early extra must carry the permit version and a visible correction field."
msgstr "先行号外には許可版番号と可視訂正欄を付す。"

#. ayaReview.aya.2
#: src/js/festival-model.js:336
msgctxt "text:ayaReview.aya.2.2"
msgid ""
"There is no early-reporting risk and almost no way for village visitors to "
"learn reroutes."
msgstr "先走りはないが、里の来訪者が迂回を知る方法もほぼない。"

#. ayaReview.aya.3.0
#: src/js/festival-model.js:337
msgctxt "text:ayaReview.aya.3.0.2"
msgid "Assign at least one messenger who will chase a carried-away noticeboard."
msgstr "運び去られた木札を追う広報員を最低一名指定。"

#. ayaReview.aya.2
#: src/js/festival-model.js:340
msgctxt "text:ayaReview.aya.2.3"
msgid "Two headlines check each other; one bell late is still before formal opening."
msgstr "二見出しが相互校正し、一鐘遅れでも正式開門前。"

#. faithReview.faith.2
#: src/js/festival-model.js:349
msgctxt "text:faithReview.faith.2"
msgid ""
"{value0} receives the sole gate; the other two parties refuse to treat it as "
"mere signage."
msgstr "{value0}が唯一正門を得ると、他二者は交通標識だけとは認めない。"

#. faithReview.faith.3.0
#: src/js/festival-model.js:350
msgctxt "text:faithReview.faith.3.0"
msgid "Separate gate credit, power, donations, and stage time into four papers."
msgstr "正門署名・給電・寄進・舞台時間を四枚へ分離。"

#. faithReview.faith.2
#: src/js/festival-model.js:353
msgctxt "text:faithReview.faith.2.2"
msgid ""
"Rotation lets each party briefly claim uniqueness and actually withdraws it "
"at the next bell."
msgstr "輪番で各者が短時間だけ唯一を名乗り、次鐘で実際に撤回される。"

#. residenceReview.residence.2
#: src/js/festival-model.js:363
msgctxt "text:residenceReview.residence.2"
msgid ""
"The residence has received a noise complaint without airborne transmission; "
"“the windows did not shake” is not a stopping rule for shared burden."
msgstr "空気伝播しない騒音申立て済み。「窓が揺れない」は共有負担の停止規則ではない。"

#. residenceReview.residence.3.0
#: src/js/festival-model.js:364
msgctxt "text:residenceReview.residence.3.0"
msgid "List separate stopping rights for late music, dream echo, and photographs inside walls."
msgstr "深夜曲・夢反響・壁内写真の停止権を別記。"

#. residenceReview.residence.2
#: src/js/festival-model.js:371
msgctxt "text:residenceReview.residence.2.2"
msgid ""
"The venue or sound may leave its filed location; the night desk requires a "
"duty person able to follow."
msgstr "会場か音が申告位置を離れ得る。共同夜机は追跡当番を要求。"

#. residenceReview.residence.3.0
#: src/js/festival-model.js:372
msgctxt "text:residenceReview.residence.3.0.2"
msgid "Reconfirm the fairy zone and residence-side soundscape every bell."
msgstr "校鐘ごとに妖精区と寮側音景を再確認。"

#. residenceReview.residence.2
#: src/js/festival-model.js:375
msgctxt "text:residenceReview.residence.2.3"
msgid "The programme ends before night duty, and the fairy zone has trackable ground."
msgstr "夜当番終了前に公演が収まり、妖精区にも追跡可能な地面がある。"

#. headline
#: src/js/festival-model.js:578
msgctxt "text:headline"
msgid "Boundary festival produces three sole main gates; Transit refuses to choose the solest"
msgstr "境界開学祭、三つの唯一正門を生成。交通室は最も唯一な門を選ばず"

#. headline
#: src/js/festival-model.js:580
msgctxt "text:headline.2"
msgid "Lantern festival closes; Eientei asks next programme to list the waiting queue"
msgstr "春季灯会閉幕、永遠亭は待合列を次回番組へ記載要求"

#. headline
#: src/js/festival-model.js:581
msgctxt "text:headline.3"
msgid "Lights close by version; unresolved objections and recovered lanterns wait for morning"
msgstr "灯は版どおり消灯。未解決異議と回収灯籠は明朝へ"

#. festivalRouteOverlay.notices.0
#: src/js/festival-model.js:657
msgctxt "text:festivalRouteOverlay.notices.0"
msgid "Festival procession and stall closures are included in routing."
msgstr "祭典行列・屋台規制を経路計算へ反映。"

#. festivalRouteOverlay.notices.1
#: src/js/festival-model.js:658
msgctxt "text:festivalRouteOverlay.notices.1"
msgid "{value0} is live."
msgstr "{value0}運行中。"

#. base.0.author
#: src/js/festival-model.js:715
msgctxt "text:base.0.author"
msgid "Joint Festival Operations Room"
msgstr "祭典共同運営室"

#. base.0.body
#: src/js/festival-model.js:721
msgctxt "text:base.0.body"
msgid ""
"Conditions and objections from six desks remain separate. Gate, power, aid, "
"and exits were not averaged."
msgstr "六つの机の条件と異議は別紙のまま。正門・電源・救護・退路を平均していません。"

#. festivalCommunityPosts.0.0.author
#: src/js/festival-model.js:733
msgctxt "text:festivalCommunityPosts.0.0.author"
msgid "Bunbunmaru Closing Extra"
msgstr "文々。閉祭号外"

#. festivalCommunityPosts.0.0.author
#: src/js/festival-model.js:746
msgctxt "text:festivalCommunityPosts.0.0.author.2"
msgid "Festival Field Wire"
msgstr "祭典現場線"

#. buildFestivalProgramme.0.1
#: src/js/festival-model.js:691
msgctxt "text:buildFestivalProgramme.0.1"
msgid "Volunteer roll, exit walk, and fourth-lantern renumbering"
msgstr "当番点呼・退路歩測・第四灯再番号"

#. buildFestivalProgramme.2.1
#: src/js/festival-model.js:693
msgctxt "text:buildFestivalProgramme.2.1"
msgid "Fairy low-altitude rehearsal and audience cue practice"
msgstr "妖精低空試演・観客予兆練習"

#. buildFestivalProgramme.3.1
#: src/js/festival-model.js:694
msgctxt "text:buildFestivalProgramme.3.1"
msgid "Night Sparrow kitchen, kappa prototypes, and village tables"
msgstr "夜雀食堂・河童試作屋台・里の長卓"

#. buildFestivalProgramme.4.1
#: src/js/festival-model.js:695
msgctxt "text:buildFestivalProgramme.4.1"
msgid "Twilight spell-card exhibition: every rule has a visible exit"
msgstr "黄昏スペル競演：全規則に見える出口"

#. buildFestivalProgramme.5.1
#: src/js/festival-model.js:696
msgctxt "text:buildFestivalProgramme.5.1"
msgid "Lantern recovery, correction extra, and first residence quiet watch"
msgstr "灯回収・訂正号外・寮の第一静夜"

#. buildFestivalProgramme.1.1
#: src/js/festival-model.js:692
msgctxt "text:buildFestivalProgramme.1.1"
msgid "{value0} opening bell"
msgstr "{value0}開門鐘"

#. festivalCommunityPosts.0.0.body
#: src/js/festival-model.js:735
msgctxt "text:festivalCommunityPosts.0.0.body"
msgid ""
"{value0} attended; {value1} medical presentations; {value2} minutes delay. "
"Objections carry into morning."
msgstr "来場 {value0}、救護 {value1}、遅延 {value2}分。異議は翌朝へ繰越。"

#. festivalCommunityPosts.0.0.title
#: src/js/festival-model.js:747
msgctxt "text:festivalCommunityPosts.0.0.title"
msgid "{value0} is live"
msgstr "{value0}運行中"

#. festivalCommunityPosts.0.0.body
#: src/js/festival-model.js:748
msgctxt "text:festivalCommunityPosts.0.0.body.2"
msgid ""
"Field cases {value0}/{value1}. Map detours and Eientei load now read this "
"operations slip."
msgstr "現場案件 {value0}/{value1}。地図の迂回と永遠亭負荷は現在の運行票を参照。"
